Source: wlan-platform-dlkm
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ben Wang <benw@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               linux-qcom-source
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://git.codelinaro.org/

Package: wlan-platform-dlkm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Wlan platform drivers
 Build wlan platform drivers to kernel modules.
 .
 Provides the following out-of-tree kernel modules:
  - cnss2.ko       : CNSS2 PCIe WLAN platform driver
  - cnss_utils.ko  : CNSS utility functions
  - wlan_firmware_service.ko : WLAN firmware QMI service
  - cnss_plat_ipc_qmi_svc.ko : CNSS platform IPC QMI service
  - cnss_nl.ko     : CNSS generic netlink driver
 .
 Also installs Module.symvers and public headers under
 /usr/include/wlan-platform/.

Package: wlan-platform-dlkm-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, wlan-platform-dlkm (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Wlan platform drivers - development headers
 Development headers and Module.symvers for building out-of-tree WLAN modules
 that depend on the wlan-platform-dlkm kernel modules.
 .
 Installs Module.symvers and public headers under /usr/include/wlan-platform/.
